  "inheritedEffect": "[All Turns] When this Digimon would leave the battle area other than by one of your effects, from this Digimon's digivolution cards, return 1 Digimon card to the hand and place 1 [X Antibody] on top of your security stack.",
  "name": "X Antibody Proto Form",
  "nameJapanese": "X抗体PF",
  "rarity": "Super Rare",
  "rule": "[Rule] Name: Also treated as [X Antibody].",
  "rulings": {
    "references": [
      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=EX5-070#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for EX5-070 (Mar. 28, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "That's correct. This card has a \"Name: Also treated as [X Antibody]\" rule, therefore a Digimon with this card in its digivolution cards isn't treated as \"1 of your Digimon without [X Antibody] in its digivolution cards.\"",
        "question": "If a Digimon has this card in its digivolution cards, does that mean that it isn't treated as \"1 of your Digimon without [X Antibody] in its digivolution cards\"?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, it activates even if only this card is in the digivolution cards.",
        "question": "Does this card's inherited effect only activate if both [X Antibody] and a Digimon card are in the digivolution cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it activates.",
        "question": "If a Digimon with this card in its digivolution cards would be deleted other than by one of my effects, then an effect such as ＜Decoy (nocategory)＞ (When your other nocategory Digimon would be deleted by an opponent's effect, you may delete this Digimon to prevent 1 of those Digimon's deletion.) prevents it from being deleted, does this card's inherited effect activate?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.  If digivolution isn't performed using this card's effect, you can't place this card in digivolution cards.",
        "question": "Can I use this card and then place this card in digivolution cards without digivolving 1 of my Digimon without [X Antibody] in its digivolution cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
